ection. The main contribution of this work is the utilization of polar representation to get the representative features for each block. The main feature used in this paper is the frequency of each block based on Fourier transform. The experimental results show the efficiency of the proposed method for detecting copy-move regions, even when the copied region has undergone severe image manipulations such as rotation, scaling, Gaussian blurring, brightness modification, JPEG compression and noise addition.","authors":[{"id":"a5012416384","name":"Yitian Wang","orcid":"0000-0002-4097-4454","institution_ids":[]},{"id":"a5066452160","name":"Sei‐ichiro Kamata","orcid":"0000-0002-1496-2417","institution_ids":["i880766802"]}],"institution_ids":["i880766802"],"venue":{"id":"venue-bd75217e252d20","name":"International Journal of Machine Learning and Computing","short_name":"","type":"journal","issn":"","rankings":[]},"task_tags":["image_forgery"],"contribution_type":"method","review_status":"verified","doi":"10.18178/ijmlc.2018.8.2.680","arxiv_id":"","openalex_id":"W2887059315","semantic_scholar_id":"","primary_url":"https://doi.org/10.18178/ijmlc.2018.8.2.680","citation_count":3,"provenance":[{"source":"openalex","source_id":"W2887059315","url":"https://openalex.org/W2887059315","query":"copy move image forgery detection","retrieved_at":"2026-07-15T06:11:49Z"},{"source":"crossref","source_id":"10.18178/ijmlc.2018.8.2.680","url":"https://doi.org/10.18178/ijmlc.2018.8.2.680","query":"copy move image forgery detection","retrieved_at":"2026-07-15T18:29:47Z"}],"notes":"快速批量核验：已有稳定来源，且现有任务标签与图像取证范围一致。"},{"id":"paper-8434f80e48b560ee","title":"Copy-move Forgery Detection Robust to Various Transformation and Degradation Attacks","title_zh":"","year":2018,"publication_date":"","abstract":"","authors":[],"institution_ids":[],"venue":{"id":"venue-e9b4feab4ded63","name":"KSII Transactions on Internet and Information Systems","short_name":"","type":"journal","issn":"1976-7277","rankings":